    <profile name="Second Indiscriminate Bombardment" typeId="c1ac-c1c8-f9d5-9673" typeName="Special Rule" hidden="false" id="a05b-0936-ae2e-cc94">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9f84-4221-785a-db50">One second time per game, a unit with this special rule can make a &quot;Drop Bomb&quot; Attack against a single enemy that is not engaged in combat. 
To do this, this unit must move (fly) over the unit it wishes to attack during the Remaining Movements subphase.
Once this unit&apos;s movement is completed, the enemy unit suffers 1D3 Strength 4 hits, each with an AP of -, for each model of this unit that moved over it.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Indiscriminate Bombardment" typeId="c1ac-c1c8-f9d5-9673" typeName="Special Rule" hidden="false" id="95e3-e279-9b68-b61b">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9f84-4221-785a-db50">Once per game, a unit with this special rule can make a &quot;Drop Bomb&quot; Attack against a single enemy that is not engaged in combat. 
To do this, this unit must move (fly) over the unit it wishes to attack during the Remaining Movements subphase.
Once this unit&apos;s movement is completed, the enemy unit suffers 1D3 Strength 4 hits, each with an AP of -, for each model of this unit that moved over it.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
