    <profile name="Queen Bess Cannon" typeId="a378-c633-912d-11ce" typeName="Weapon" hidden="false" id="0191-29ab-2dad-5492">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="R" typeId="2360-c777-5e07-ed58">12-72&quot;</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="S" typeId="ac19-f99c-72e9-a1a7">4(8)</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="AP" typeId="9429-ffe7-2ce5-e9a5">-1(-3)</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Special Rules" typeId="5f83-3633-336b-93b4">Bombardment, Move or Shoot, Multiple Wounds (D3+1), Incendiary Power, Slow Reload</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Notes" typeId="772a-a7ff-f6b3-df71">This weapon fires like a Catapult, using the &apos;Boarding&apos; special rule, a 5&quot; area template, and the Gunpowder Weapon Problems table. 
The multiple wounds (1D3+1) special rule applies only to a single model whose base It is located below the center hole of the area template.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Slow Recharge" typeId="c1ac-c1c8-f9d5-9673" typeName="Special Rule" hidden="false" id="d7fd-d7d4-fddc-f2e2">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9f84-4221-785a-db50">If this weapon fired during your previous turn, it may not be able to fire during this turn. 



Roll 1D6 before firing with this weapon. 


On a roll of 1-2, the slow, tedious reloading process has not yet been completed and the weapon does not fire this turn. 


If Queen Bess has an Ogre Charger, you can apply a +1 modifier to this roll.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Incendiary Gunpowder" typeId="c1ac-c1c8-f9d5-9673" typeName="Special Rule" hidden="false" id="515e-5c15-2831-ab7d">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9f84-4221-785a-db50">The impact leaves a scorched and burning earth that is difficult to cross. 
A unit hit by this weapon that moves on its next turn will count as moving on Difficult Terrain.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
