    <profile name="Point Blank Shoot" typeId="a378-c633-912d-11ce" typeName="Weapon" hidden="false" id="1704-01c9-fdcb-8f9b">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="R" typeId="2360-c777-5e07-ed58">Combat</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="S" typeId="ac19-f99c-72e9-a1a7">5</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="AP" typeId="9429-ffe7-2ce5-e9a5">-1</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Special Rules" typeId="5f83-3633-336b-93b4">Armor Bane (2)</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Notes" typeId="772a-a7ff-f6b3-df71">Instead of attacking normally, the Necrofex Colossus can choose to make a special attack with this weapon. If he does, place the small (3&quot;) area template so that its center hole is directly over the center of the unit that was hit. Any enemy model whose base is below the template risks being hit by it.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Hand Cannon" typeId="a378-c633-912d-11ce" typeName="Weapon" hidden="false" id="a038-316c-7816-5c98">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="R" typeId="2360-c777-5e07-ed58">30&quot;</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="S" typeId="ac19-f99c-72e9-a1a7">7</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="AP" typeId="9429-ffe7-2ce5-e9a5">-2</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Special Rules" typeId="5f83-3633-336b-93b4">Armor Bane (2), Cannon Shot, Multiple Wounds (D3)</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Notes" typeId="772a-a7ff-f6b3-df71">Use the rules for Cannons in Pag.227 in the Warhammer: The Old World Rulebook, the difference is that it can be fired even if the bearer has moved, but not if he has charged or marched.
Additionally, a trouble result will cause the Necrofex Colossus to automatically lose a wound with no saving throw chance of any kind, instead of rolling on the table.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
