  <sharedInfoGroups>
    <infoGroup name="Lore of the Deep" id="7bac-9039-7e5c-d17a" hidden="false">
      <comment>Lore of Magic</comment>
      <profiles>
        <profile name="Fog of the Damned" typeId="8232-ae14-b1f6-b4df" typeName="Spell" hidden="false" id="177a-b64f-b839-8409">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Number" typeId="8a2b-690b-e552-6aa0">1</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Type" typeId="c2ca-5fd1-5e9d-bc90">Hex</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Casting Value" typeId="d84d-3b8b-654a-9e1a">7+</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Range" typeId="1043-a0ad-2909-dd28">24&quot;</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="64ba-31-acf0-5a">Until your next start-of-turn phase, the affected unit takes a -1 penalty on its hit rolls, both in melee and projectile.


War machines must roll 1d6 when trying to shoot, with a 4+ they can shoot with normalize, otherwise they will not be able to shoot in his next shooting phase.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Spiteful Shot" typeId="8232-ae14-b1f6-b4df" typeName="Spell" hidden="false" id="b8dc-1c58-bea3-ecb2">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Number" typeId="8a2b-690b-e552-6aa0">2</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Type" typeId="c2ca-5fd1-5e9d-bc90">Enchantment</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Casting Value" typeId="d84d-3b8b-654a-9e1a">6+/9+</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Range" typeId="1043-a0ad-2909-dd28">18&quot;</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="64ba-31-acf0-5a">Until your next turn start phase, if this spell is cast with a casting result of 6 or more, the target unit can reroll rolls of 1 on hit with its projectile weapons.


If the roll result is 9 or more, the target unit may re-roll all of its rolls to hit with its projectile weapons.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Kraken&apos;s Pull" typeId="8232-ae14-b1f6-b4df" typeName="Spell" hidden="false" id="4559-b8c7-a8fe-d145">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Number" typeId="8a2b-690b-e552-6aa0">3</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Type" typeId="c2ca-5fd1-5e9d-bc90">Magical Vortex</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Casting Value" typeId="d84d-3b8b-654a-9e1a">9+</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Range" typeId="1043-a0ad-2909-dd28">12&quot;</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="64ba-31-acf0-5a">Remains in play. Place the Large Area (5&quot;) template with its center hole up to 12&quot; from the launcher. While in play, the template is treated as dangerous terrain. 
The template moves 1D6&quot; in a random direction during each Start of Turn subphase.
Any unit (friendly or enemy) that is touched or moved on the template receives 1D3+3 Strength 4 hits, each with an AP of -1, also, the unit will suffer a -1 to its Movement characteristic until the start of the Vampire Coast player’s turn.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
    </infoGroup>
  </sharedInfoGroups>
